*
# INT-515: deny by default, then re-include only what the voice-runtime image
# needs: the uv workspace (every member's pyproject is needed to honour
# uv.lock), the model registry the runtime reads at runtime, the server pin
# the image installs, and the lane registry's committed files (infra/).
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/
!services/
!observability/
!infra/
# Never sent, wherever they sit. The host's root-only env file lives outside
# the tree (/etc/intake-staging), and these rules catch a stray copy anyway.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.cache
**/dist
packages/embed-sdk
